# Build artifacts (root and every workspace member)
target/
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb

# mdBook output (improvement plan T301) — generated by `mdbook build`,
# deployed to GitHub Pages by CI, never committed.
/book/

# Workspace members share the root Cargo.lock; ignore stale per-member lockfiles.
vix-*/Cargo.lock

# Hunspell spell-check dictionaries (~287 MB); fetched separately, not vendored.
# See crates/vix-spellcheck/spec/dictionaries/index.md. Root-anchored: an
# unanchored `dictionaries/` also matched `docs/dictionaries/` (the real docs
# page for this feature), silently keeping it out of every commit — found via
# a CI-only `check-docs`/lychee failure invisible locally, where the
# untracked files still sat on disk.
/dictionaries/

# Fuzzing: the generated corpus and any crash inputs. A crash worth keeping
# becomes a unit test in the crate that owns the code, not a committed blob.
# See fuzz/README.md.
fuzz/corpus/
fuzz/artifacts/
fuzz/coverage/
